WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:05.370
. So we have completely predictable and yet
blockbuster bombshell news related to this

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:06.990
Russian bounty story.

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:12.900
So yesterday we kind of gave you the initial
outline of this story as the story goes.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:18.330
We learned a few days ago, thanks to reporting
from The New York Times, that Russia was offering

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.570
cash bounties.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:29.410
It's like a bonus for Taliban connected troops
who killed U.S. or coalition troops in Afghanistan.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:33.570
And immediately the question was, does Trump
know about this?

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:34.790
Did Trump know about this?

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:39.820
Was Trump aware of this when he was glad handing
with Vladimir Putin, saying Putin should be

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:41.010
part of the G8?

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:43.160
Let's make the G7, the G8 again.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.900
We heard nothing from the White House for
24 hours.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.840
Then we started getting statements that Trump
was never briefed on it.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.790
Trump simply had no idea.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.140
Why wasn't Trump briefed?

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:53.250
It wasn't really clear.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:57.050
There were claims that it wasn't considered
credible enough to brief Donald Trump.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:00.830
There were claims that it just Trump doesn't
get briefed about everything that's going

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:01.830
on.

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:06.120
But it was weird because we knew that the
National Security Council had indeed taken

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.490
up this issue.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:12.050
We started hearing from other elected officials
who said, well, I had heard about this issue.

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:17.530
We learned that British intelligence and a
top British politicians were aware of and

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:18.530
discussing this.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:22.200
So it started to become a little difficult
to believe that Donald Trump had not actually

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.220
been briefed.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.060
But they insisted on it.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:32.190
Kaley McKenny, Donald Trump's press secretary,
when asked about this, said indeed that Donald

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:35.220
Trump was not briefed because the intelligence
was not credible.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:41.390
I'll say this, that the U.S. receives thousands
of reports a day on intelligence and they're

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:46.100
subject to strict scrutiny while the White
House does not routinely comment on alleged

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.130
intelligence or internal deliberations.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:53.650
The CIA director, NSA national security adviser
and the chief of staff can all confirm.

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:58.299
And neither the president nor the vice president
were briefed on the alleged friendship, Russian

00:01:58.299 --> 00:01:59.530
bounty intelligence.

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:02.440
Has he been since briefed since all these
reports came out?

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:08.030
So let me back up and say this, that there
is no consensus within the intelligence community

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:09.629
on these allegations.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:14.569
And in fact, there are dissenting opinions
from some in the intelligence community with

00:02:14.569 --> 00:02:19.939
regards to the veracity of what's being reported
on in the veracity of the underlying allegations

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:21.409
continue to be evaluated.

00:02:21.409 --> 00:02:25.129
So, again, it didn't really pass the sniff
test.

00:02:25.129 --> 00:02:27.920
We knew it went to the National Security Council.

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:32.939
And now we have multiple sources saying that
Trump knew all along.

00:02:32.939 --> 00:02:33.939
Anybody shocked?

00:02:33.939 --> 00:02:40.270
The New York Times, The Associated Press,
CNN, all reporting about different sources

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:43.370
who say Trump was briefed, Trump knew.

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:45.319
So let's go through some of the different
claims.

00:02:45.319 --> 00:02:50.739
There's a New York Times report which says
that Trump was briefed in February of this

00:02:50.739 --> 00:02:51.739
year.

00:02:51.739 --> 00:02:54.659
OK, so that would be like four or five months
ago.

00:02:54.659 --> 00:02:59.799
And that Trump was briefed about the Russian
bounties in his presidential daily briefing.

00:02:59.799 --> 00:03:04.549
Now, the thing about it being in the presidential
daily briefing is that we know that that has

00:03:04.549 --> 00:03:08.329
been a challenging text for Donald Trump.

00:03:08.329 --> 00:03:12.799
Presidential daily briefings with other presidents
have been 30, 40 pages long and come with

00:03:12.799 --> 00:03:15.340
quite a long briefing with intelligence staff.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:19.780
Donald Trump doesn't read oftentimes as he
has been given the briefings.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.829
He's watching a TV that's in the back of the
room.

00:03:22.829 --> 00:03:26.361
The presidential daily briefing was short
and short and shortened all the way to one

00:03:26.361 --> 00:03:27.519
page.

00:03:27.519 --> 00:03:28.709
One page was too much.

00:03:28.709 --> 00:03:34.889
So it was shortened to just a few bullet points
with a picture or two, like a graph or a chart.

00:03:34.889 --> 00:03:38.189
And even then, we don't know that Donald Trump
is actually looking at it.

00:03:38.189 --> 00:03:42.669
So it seems as though it was at minimum in
the presidential daily briefing.

00:03:42.669 --> 00:03:45.260
Whether Trump actually looked at it is a question
mark.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.999
Whether Trump remembers it is another question
mark.

00:03:47.999 --> 00:03:53.059
Because as we've said before, Donald Trump
and his memory problems, there have been wide

00:03:53.059 --> 00:03:57.120
allegations that Trump genuinely doesn't remember
a damn thing.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.230
So that's The New York Times report.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:00.709
Then we have a CNN report.

00:04:00.709 --> 00:04:07.529
CNN has its own sources which say that Donald
Trump was briefed directly about the Russian

00:04:07.529 --> 00:04:09.249
bounty story in spring.

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:12.840
So spring could be March, April, May ish.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:16.560
The New York Times report says certainly February
2020.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:21.440
The CNN report says it was a little more recent
sometime in spring of 2020.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:26.590
You then have a third report from the Associated
Press which says that top officials in the

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:35.300
White House were aware of the Russian bounty's
situation early last year in 2019, a full

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:41.150
year earlier than The New York Times and Associate
and CNN are currently reporting.

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:46.039
And then we heard from Democratic Senator
Chris Murphy, who says that the argument that

00:04:46.039 --> 00:04:51.699
this was not credible information is is a
wrong it's a bad argument that he saw the

00:04:51.699 --> 00:04:56.789
intelligence, that it is clearly not a hoax
and that that would not be a valid reason

00:04:56.789 --> 00:04:59.390
for keeping this information from Donald Trump.

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:04.789
So on day one, really, day two, because they
didn't say anything about it for 24 hours

00:05:04.789 --> 00:05:08.099
when the White House first said Trump was
never briefed.

00:05:08.099 --> 00:05:10.159
We assumed that that was a lie.

00:05:10.159 --> 00:05:16.199
The details are now confirming it with New
York Times, CNN and Associated Press sources

00:05:16.199 --> 00:05:20.040
all saying the president was indeed briefed.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.410
This sort of reminded me.

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.129
You know, Trump has this.

00:05:23.129 --> 00:05:25.740
Hear no evil Seno evil sort of mentality.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:31.700
Trump recently said multiple times I was encouraging
less testing because less testing means we

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.759
find fewer cases.

00:05:33.759 --> 00:05:39.129
It would be analogous to saying if we cancel
border patrol, we're not going to catch anybody

00:05:39.129 --> 00:05:40.319
crossing the border.

00:05:40.319 --> 00:05:41.500
Problem solved.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:42.500
Right.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.180
This is sort of another example of that.

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:49.409
If Trump stops reading reports on terrorism
or he pretends they don't exist or he ignores

00:05:49.409 --> 00:05:52.370
them, then it's sort of like the terrorism
isn't going on.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:55.730
If he doesn't remember or doesn't read or
doesn't pay attention to the Russian bounty

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:56.730
story.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:58.229
It's sort of like it's not going on.

00:05:58.229 --> 00:06:02.039
And of course, the implications are absolutely
insane.

00:06:02.039 --> 00:06:09.229
Donald Trump allegedly being aware of the
Russian bounty story, still was publicly arguing

00:06:09.229 --> 00:06:15.469
that he wants Vladimir Putin and Russia back
in the G7 to make it the G8. Trump invited

00:06:15.469 --> 00:06:23.740
the Taliban to go to Camp David and meet with
him, allegedly after knowing that they were

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:29.000
being paid bounties when they were killing
U.S. or coalition troops.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:33.970
Trump ended up having to cancel that secret
meeting with the Taliban because things went

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:37.060
haywire and people rightly said, what the
hell are you doing here?

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:39.190
What what exactly is the idea here?

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:41.189
Abruptly getting canceled.

00:06:41.189 --> 00:06:48.990
Trump was withholding aid to Ukraine, an ally
aid that would have been used to resist aggression

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:56.470
from Russia after he was briefed that Russia
was offering bounties when Taliban linked

00:06:56.470 --> 00:07:00.830
individuals killed the U.S. or coalition forces.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:04.169
So that none of it is surprising.

00:07:04.169 --> 00:07:06.469
The lies are not surprising.

00:07:06.469 --> 00:07:08.749
The duplicitous nature of what's being said.

00:07:08.749 --> 00:07:10.289
But none of it is surprising.

00:07:10.289 --> 00:07:13.659
But I think now we don't want to get stuck
on.

00:07:13.659 --> 00:07:14.970
When did Trump know?

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.220
And did Trump know from clearly was told.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.979
And he was told a while ago whether he retained
it or not.

00:07:20.979 --> 00:07:22.909
That's that's a different question.

00:07:22.909 --> 00:07:28.449
Trump now knows it's now been what are we
on day five since this story broke?

00:07:28.449 --> 00:07:29.979
What is Trump doing now?

00:07:29.979 --> 00:07:32.729
What has Trump done since finding out last
week?

00:07:32.729 --> 00:07:34.860
We're hearing very little about that.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:38.779
And that is arguably as important a story
as when Trump knew and who told him

